        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award winning and genre defining video game, <strong>Timothy 3</strong>, is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first Timothy-type game you will face a plural amount of <i>headache inducing</i> challenges. Some  will rage-quit and refund the game within minutes, while some will think it's a breeze, complete the game and also refund it within minutes. (Please don't).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you *<strong>points finger</strong>*, yes you. You will recognize a true masterpiece when you see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.poster.avif?t=1761923091\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.webm?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.mp4?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a different plane of existence and embody Timothy with only the <i>other</i> voice to guide you. As Timothy, you have 1 minute to complete the task the voice gives you. Frantic running, munching, grabbing, chopping and throwing required. Even jumping is a monumental task for poor Timothy. The game should last for an average playthrough of 30 minutes, while it is possible to complete in the first minute. 100 % achievements may take up to 1,5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.poster.avif?t=1761923091\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.webm?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.mp4?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking stuff up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing said stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood chopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome narrator</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award winning and genre defining video game, <strong>Timothy 3</strong>, is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first Timothy-type game you will face a plural amount of <i>headache inducing</i> challenges. Some  will rage-quit and refund the game within minutes, while some will think it's a breeze, complete the game and also refund it within minutes. (Please don't).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you *<strong>points finger</strong>*, yes you. You will recognize a true masterpiece when you see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.poster.avif?t=1761923091\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.webm?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.mp4?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a different plane of existence and embody Timothy with only the <i>other</i> voice to guide you. As Timothy, you have 1 minute to complete the task the voice gives you. Frantic running, munching, grabbing, chopping and throwing required. Even jumping is a monumental task for poor Timothy. The game should last for an average playthrough of 30 minutes, while it is possible to complete in the first minute. 100 % achievements may take up to 1,5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.poster.avif?t=1761923091\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.webm?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.mp4?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking stuff up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing said stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood chopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome narrator</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Have you ever felt like, &quot;damn, I'm always so tranquil, I need some more frustration and stress in my life&quot;? Then oh boy do I got the game for you! Join Timothy on his 1 minute adventure in the beyond. Jump, run and throw stuff, oh but don't let the timer run out!",
